sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as Resource API
    participant A as Auth server
    participant DB as Token store
    C->>API: Request with access token (expired)
    API-->>C: 401 Unauthorized
    C->>A: POST /token (refresh_token R1)
    A->>DB: Look up R1, mark used
    A->>DB: Store R2 in same family
    A-->>C: New access token + R2
    C->>API: Retry with new access token
    API-->>C: 200 OK
    Note over A,DB: Reuse of R1 revokes the whole family
